{
  "id": "impulse_and_impulse_force",
  "title": "Impulse and Impulse Force",
  "description": "Calculate impulse, force, momentum change, and resulting velocity based on Newton's Second Law of Motion. Impulse forces act for a very short time and the impulse equals the change of momentum.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Impulse and Impulse Force\n\nForces acting for a very short time are called impulse forces. According to Newton's Second Law of Motion:\n\n**F = dM / dt**\n\nWhere:\n- F = applied force (N)\n- dM = change of momentum (kg m/s)\n- dt = time taken (s)\n\nThe impulse I = F × dt = dM (change in momentum)\n\nMomentum M = m × v, where m is mass (kg) and v is velocity (m/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "force",
          "label": "Force",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "N",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "time",
          "label": "Time",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "s",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "mass",
          "label": "Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "impulse",
          "label": "Impulse",
          "formula": "inputs.force * inputs.time",
          "unit": "N s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "momentum_change",
          "label": "Change in Momentum",
          "formula": "inputs.force * inputs.time",
          "unit": "kg m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "resulting_velocity",
          "label": "Resulting Velocity",
          "formula": "(inputs.force * inputs.time) / inputs.mass",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Symbol",
        "Unit",
        "Value"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Applied Force",
          "F",
          "N",
          "inputs.force"
        ],
        [
          "Time Duration",
          "dt",
          "s",
          "inputs.time"
        ],
        [
          "Mass",
          "m",
          "kg",
          "inputs.mass"
        ],
        [
          "Impulse",
          "I",
          "N s",
          "inputs.force * inputs.time"
        ],
        [
          "Change in Momentum",
          "dM",
          "kg m/s",
          "inputs.force * inputs.time"
        ],
        [
          "Resulting Velocity",
          "v",
          "m/s",
          "(inputs.force * inputs.time) / inputs.mass"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}